  "body": [
    "Homepage",
    "Find your course",
    "Change what’s next with a University of Nottingham degree. Gain real-world experience, build in-demand skills and graduate ready to succeed at the UK’s top university for highly skilled graduate jobs (HESA 2026).",
    "See what life at Nottingham is really like. Explore your subject, tour our campuses and talk to the people who’ll support you – from academics to current students.",
    "Find out how to apply, key dates and what happens after you submit your application.",
    "Get answers to your questions – from course choices to student life, finance and accommodation.",
    "Join a truly global community. Discover entry requirements, fees, scholarships and support.",
    "Get updates on courses, events and application advice – straight to your inbox.",
    "Make a Nottingham education more affordable. Our scholarships reward academic excellence, leadership potential and financial need – helping to reduce tuition fees and living costs.",
    "Each of our campuses has its own character, community and specialist facilities. Wherever you’re based, you’ll find the space, support and opportunities to thrive.",
    "Feel at home in Nottingham. Choose from a range of accommodation close to your studies, with easy access to campus, social spaces and sport facilities.",
    "Stay active and get involved. From social sport to elite competition, you’ll find facilities, clubs and support for every level.",
    "Live and learn in one of the UK’s best student cities. With culture, nightlife and green spaces on your doorstep, there’s something for everyone.",
    "Discover how studying at Nottingham can help you build the skills, ideas and confidence to shape what comes next.",
    "for number of graduates in highly skilled jobs",
    "in Russell Group for work experience",
    "in the world",
    "UK student city",
    "Your success after graduation is just as important as your time on campus. That's why we're committed to empowering you to achieve your dreams, whatever they may be.",
